/T (PeoplesHR is moving toward a vision where HR runs through intelligence and conversation. v10.3 upgrades the intelligence behind Lexi AI Insights and brings it to mobile. Lexi Super Agent has also been upgraded with the new MAO \(Multi-Agent Orchestrator\) model: a single agent now capable of handling requests across HR, PAY, and TIME in one conversation. )
/E (PeoplesHR is moving toward a vision where HR runs through intelligence and conversation. v10.3 upgrades the intelligence behind Lexi AI Insights and brings it to mobile. Lexi Super Agent has also been upgraded with the new MAO \(Multi-Agent Orchestrator\) model: a single agent now capable of handling requests across HR, PAY, and TIME in one conversation. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
