<<
/Title (Migration approach: Legacy templates were converted via an AI-assisted transformation with manual governance, preserving all existing tokens and placeholders to avoid notification failures. Header and footer branding now resolves automatically through hierarchy-based configuration, including a configurable default hierarchy code. Useful for partners managing multi-entity or multi-brand clients.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3117 0 R
/First 3148 0 R
/Last 3149 0 R
/Count -2
>>
endobj
3136 0 obj
<<
