<<
/Title (Configuration: Validation rules are configurable per Pay Group, can be enabled or disabled individually, and are classified as Informational, Warning, or Blocker. They can be run manually \(single or bulk\), in real time from the dashboard, or on a schedule. Unresolved Blocker-level issues prevent payroll processing until reviewed and either resolved or explicitly accepted.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3138 0 R
>>
endobj
3151 0 obj
<<
/Title (Migration note: The legacy Monday-to-Sunday WFO/WFH toggle grid is retired with this release. Existing data is migrated through a one-time script covering the remainder of the calendar year; dates beyond that migration horizon fall back at read time to a configurable tenant baseline arrangement. Plan a data/config conversation with clients ahead of upgrade.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3140 0 R
/Next 3159 0 R
>>
endobj
3152 0 obj
<<
/Title (Bulk location upload: Handles 1,000 to 2,000 rows per file via a validate-then-preview-then-save flow, with a downloadable error report for any rows that fail. HR can start from a blank template or pre-fill with selected employees.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3140 0 R
/Prev 3159 0 R
>>
endobj
